physicalRef: card_auth/database
description: "Card and e-commerce fraud Link Analysis showcase - One row per card authorisation: card, merchant, amount, instant, the device and IP of an online purchase (blank at a terminal) and the result (approved, declined, or refund for money returned to the card). One file per month (CARD_AUTH_YYYYMM.csv); the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the card_auth Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: auth_at
columns[8]{name,type,classification}:
  auth_id,string,
  card_id,string,
  merchant_id,string,
  amount,number,
  auth_at,timestamp,
  device_id,string,
  ip,string,
  result,string,
